## State

Run state is persisted in artifacts under the run workdir. Only `booping playbook-transition` writes it — never hand-edit an artifact's `status:` or hook-written keys.

Read the whole run's frontier before starting or resuming:

```
booping playbook-state {{ playbook }} --workdir <run workdir>
```
